WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.480
This exercise tests the boundary between
untrusted content and tool authority.

00:00:04.584 --> 00:00:08.880
Retrieved documents or tool output
can contain instructions, but they cannot

00:00:08.949 --> 00:00:13.440
expand the agent's permissions.
The runtime proposes an action,

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:17.280
and an external gateway checks
identity, resource and approval.

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:21.040
A denied request should
leave no side effect,

00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:24.880
terminate or escalate within
bounds, and retain evidence.

00:00:25.088 --> 00:00:28.240
Test recovery as well as
the model's verbal refusal.
